  "bodyHash": "61ac128c5b24323e",
  "content": "\n\n<h2>全部粉丝自制唱片</h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>全部粉丝自制唱片&nbsp;</strong>是一款为游戏添加新的《我的世界》音乐唱片的模组，旨在为游戏增加更多目标与冒险感。</p>\n<p>它为游戏添加了 79 张新音乐唱片，其中 26 张加入原版战利品表，3 张可通过合成获得，3 张出现在新结构中，还包括自定义生物掉落物。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/w8slxdJ.png\" alt=\"ATFMD Banner\" width=\"1121\" height=\"312\"></p>\n<p><em>（此截图使用了 Complementary 光影和 BYG 模组）</em></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>本模组灵感来源于 Yomikester238 制作的《Minecraft All Fan Made Discs》资源包第 1、2、3、4、5、6 部。</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#36f\"><a style=\"color:#36f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://www.planetminecraft.com/collection/123393/all-the-fan-made-discs/\" rel=\"nofollow\">（原始资源包）</a></span><br><br><br>目前，79 张唱片中仅有 25 张可在生存模式中获得（<strong>开发中</strong>）。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>这里提供了一个资源包，用于为模组&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/visual-overhaul\" rel=\"nofollow\">Visual Overhaul</a>&nbsp;的圆形唱片功能添加兼容性：&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#36f\"><a style=\"color:#36f\" href=\"https://github.com/SuperNoobYT/RoudDiscs-ATFMD/releases\" rel=\"nofollow\">RoundDiscs-ATFMD</a></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#000\"><img src=\"https://assets-global.website-files.com/6257adef93867e50d84d30e2/636e0a6a49cf127bf92de1e2_icon_clyde_blurple_RGB.png\" alt=\"ATFMD Discord\" width=\"49\" height=\"37\"><a style=\"background-color:#ffffff\" href=\"https://discord.gg/7yZN3TMgaD\" rel=\"nofollow\">加入 Discord 服务器</a></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>免责声明</strong></p>\n<p>这些歌曲和唱片贴图的版权受其各自许可协议约束。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><strong>视频：</strong></h3>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>Yomikester238 的介绍视频：</p>\n<p><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/DnU7GpLZIjE?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>法语介绍视频（含英文字幕）</p>\n<p><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/A1o7z7NstLM?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><strong>音乐列表：</strong></h3>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>4Pointzx 创作：&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=FAzpBWToeSM\" rel=\"nofollow\">12</a>,&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7Li9c-OMDCU\" rel=\"nofollow\">Prism</a></p>\n<p>2R8B7 创作：&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vpGkgwwsdHo\" rel=\"nofollow\">Woodland</a></p>\n<p>Abysser GG 创作：&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7h4LztBfkXI\" rel=\"nofollow\">Chaos</a></p>\n<p>A piece of a pie 创作：&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tL4D6cDd4eY\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pumpking</a></p>\n<p>BenjaMint 创作：&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ybwCE5Pr6HE\" rel=\"nofollow\">Voyage</a></p>\n<p>Beto Damian 创作：&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://youtu.be/WLr07HRPSF4\" rel=\"nofollow\">Wozzy</a></p>\n<p>Black Jacket 创作：&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=IENqMrSKvbI\" rel=\"nofollow\">Vibrate</a></p>\n<p>CarrotAndCo 创作：&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qEn8iS36TAo\" rel=\"nofollow\">Carrot</a></p>\n<p>Case 创作：&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fyoutu.be%252fPh3cFLJC8u0\" rel=\"nofollow\">Prism</a>（已重命名为 Prismarine IG）</p>\n<p>Chill Crafter 创作：&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xO0eQgaxZkk\" rel=\"nofollow\">Phantom</a></p>\n<p>Deesaster 创作：&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qUc5ih3ER00\" rel=\"nofollow\">Float</a></p>\n<p>Epicuras 创作：&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MtC3jY5_NZY\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cradle</a>,&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=h4yggJ1wbP0\" rel=\"nofollow\">Downward</a>,&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=F7Ch_HWUKNc\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fledling</a></p>\n<p>E_Pixelz / 创作：&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://youtu.be/qtCSQzYZgPI\" rel=\"nofollow\">Arcade</a>,&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://youtu.be/vlcFIBPwzSo\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ice and Rain</a></p>\n<p>Firch 创作：&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://youtu.be/tnxWZFoiczQ\" rel=\"nofollow\">Anti</a>,&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://youtu.be/bz6f3maEUqs\" rel=\"nofollow\">Range</a></p>\n<p>GreenBurning 创作：&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://youtu.be/pR7RBz55Ll0\" rel=\"nofollow\">Clay</a></p>\n<p>Gwyd 创作：&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://youtu.be/pKEPyujnbZA\" rel=\"nofollow\">CHARR</a>,&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://youtu.be/R1reWbt6zkY\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bricks</a>,&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://youtu.be/K1FUb6JNJtw\" rel=\"nofollow\">GHOST</a>,&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://youtu.be/CyDYUPpobro\" rel=\"nofollow\">Tricks</a></p>\n<p>JamiesName 创作：&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://youtu.be/LBB0abQtMqA\" rel=\"nofollow\">18</a>,&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://youtu.be/2Tkmh7JH7zg\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pillaged</a>,&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UXR9QgaMbjw\" rel=\"nofollow\">Shulk</a></p>\n<p>Jupiter and co 创作：&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://youtu.be/pJxhHuZqP1c\" rel=\"nofollow\">Waldeinsamkeit</a></p>\n<p>Kaz Yumayui 创作：&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://r1915.bandcamp.com/track/chorus\" rel=\"nofollow\">Chorus</a></p>\n<p>Kowhai 创作：&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RK58x3-m27g&ab_channel=Kowhai\" rel=\"nofollow\">Etheral</a></p>\n<p>LostAngel 创作：&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://youtu.be/oa5hsIRoMGk\" rel=\"nofollow\">14 Revamped</a>,&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://youtu.be/LNi19meR5mA\" rel=\"nofollow\">DRIFTER</a>,&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://youtu.be/znf5Ymc_8-U\" rel=\"nofollow\">MellowFruit</a></p>\n<p>Medlek 创作：&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://youtu.be/Y6b4V4rvmNw\" rel=\"nofollow\">Stew</a></p>\n<p>Mango unit 创作：&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://youtu.be/iT1j2juREp0\" rel=\"nofollow\">Scopophobia</a></p>\n<p>MapleMickey 创作：&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://youtu.be/owz9LIXg1RQ\" rel=\"nofollow\">Shock</a></p>\n<p>Musical-MOE 创作：&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://youtu.be/Oqb5pBzyzys\" rel=\"nofollow\">Axolotl</a>,&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://youtu.be/6ttghHlgNPQ\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bedrock</a>,&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://youtu.be/09HIp6EObHA\" rel=\"nofollow\">Under A Beautifully Dark Sky</a></p>\n<p>Naps The Block 创作：&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://youtu.be/M9r4tdk_FoY\" rel=\"nofollow\">Omen</a>,&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://youtu.be/-U4t1B8IARU\" rel=\"nofollow\">Tall</a></p>\n<p>Pikpik36 创作：&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://youtu.be/qB-SE4IO-Yo\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ice</a></p>\n<p>Pretty Decent 创作：&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://youtu.be/rtxeAzwIGK4\" rel=\"nofollow\">Frozen</a>,&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://youtu.be/M9jeiqNN2Ys\" rel=\"nofollow\">Juke</a></p>\n<p>Prod.Akobel 创作：&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://youtu.be/IgE2uKiu7gQ\" rel=\"nofollow\">Enderwave</a></p>\n<p>Pugasaur 创作：&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://youtu.be/wt2DU-Lg0L8\" rel=\"nofollow\">Trouble In The Mansion</a></p>\n<p>RedWolfNinja 创作：&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://youtu.be/mqHUyStIOO0\" rel=\"nofollow\">Into the jungle</a>,&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://youtu.be/hQIrG2q-IOo\" rel=\"nofollow\">The bright side</a></p>\n<p>Repulsive-Vegetable5 创作：&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://www.reddit.com/r/Minecraft/comments/mbq9u8/i_made_my_own_ocean_disc_with_a_soundtrack/\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ocean Disc</a></p>\n<p>RinaXTune 创作：&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://youtu.be/iNPKW3RhJUQ\" rel=\"nofollow\">Industrial Green</a></p>\n<p>Rip Bot208 创作：&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://youtu.be/wwfkgQ4pPy0\" rel=\"nofollow\">Moonthical</a></p>\n<p>Rysm 创作：&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://youtu.be/_c8zeZAUwj4\" rel=\"nofollow\">Warped</a></p>\n<p>Sillst 创作：&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://youtu.be/-gbVj-UmJbg\" rel=\"nofollow\">Wandering Soul</a></p>\n<p>Skilpadde14 创作：&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://youtu.be/wlpbZylEJB4\" rel=\"nofollow\">Moobloom</a>,&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://youtu.be/4-NUpPl33pY\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mushroom island</a></p>\n<p>Someone 创作：&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://youtu.be/CR7VTNHPRiQ\" rel=\"nofollow\">Chill</a></p>\n<p>Spooky Skeleton 创作：&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://youtu.be/LquI54y9jOw\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cloud</a></p>\n<p>Tandem Music 创作：&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://youtu.be/uRrjnXLWKJc\" rel=\"nofollow\">Over</a></p>\n<p>Terraainn 创作：&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://youtu.be/bhbqD2HgWm4\" rel=\"nofollow\">Deep</a>,&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://youtu.be/qtpLObb8p6o\" rel=\"nofollow\">Descent</a>,&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://youtu.be/Ob2uRPJM5IA\" rel=\"nofollow\">Finale</a>,&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://youtu.be/H0ufbGDwR5I\" rel=\"nofollow\">Lush</a>,&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://youtu.be/rTRFUAHT24I\" rel=\"nofollow\">Remnant</a>,&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://youtu.be/aGYoBiNx91M\" rel=\"nofollow\">Steve</a>,&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://youtu.be/SLNXSbQxbQM\" rel=\"nofollow\">Storm</a>,&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://youtu.be/IXfIlB6FKtA\" rel=\"nofollow\">Oxidization</a></p>\n<p>Thaumic Lad 创作：&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2Cwwir2lWJM&t=60s&ab_channel=ThaumicLad\" rel=\"nofollow\">Orestep</a></p>\n<p>The Bling-Bling Cheese 创作：&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://youtu.be/0JI2vx68ol8\" rel=\"nofollow\">Birch bop</a>,&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://youtu.be/Msc5dAxHIws\" rel=\"nofollow\">Brain Sploshed</a>,&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://youtu.be/mO2oCKKsWK8\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fort-stress</a>,&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://youtu.be/FmCxA0StuVE\" rel=\"nofollow\">Time</a></p>\n<p>The Watcher 创作：&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://youtu.be/opVCIiPxYZc\" rel=\"nofollow\">Withering</a></p>\n<p>ToastDot.39 创作：&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://youtu.be/HxWeeb3UACw\" rel=\"nofollow\">Weird</a></p>\n<p>Toma 创作：&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://youtu.be/gEGiT1GMe-M\" rel=\"nofollow\">ChikenBoat</a></p>\n<p>Yekonaip 创作：&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://youtu.be/6pblYe_f4Y8\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mushroom (Biomes: Swampland)</a></p>\n<p>Wealsor 创作：&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://youtu.be/1IKWUKnXYK4\" rel=\"nofollow\">String</a></p>\n<p>Wet Hamester 创作：&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://youtu.be/8rJ74aIiAQo\" rel=\"nofollow\">Coral Lullaby</a></p>\n<p>Xx<em>coxy-editz</em>xX 创作：&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://youtu.be/61BvQKmL0K0\" rel=\"nofollow\">14</a></p>\n<p>zoo937 创作：&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://youtu.be/AqXVPcthSE0\" rel=\"nofollow\">Evoker</a></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><strong>常见问题：</strong></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#000\"><strong>会移植到 Forge 吗？：不会，我没有时间学习 Forge 模组开发，我专注于添加新功能。</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#000\"><strong>有计划回退旧版本吗？：没有，我专注于最新的《我的世界》版本以及添加新功能。</strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f00\"><strong>/!\\ 请注意，本模组仍在开发中</strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>如果你的唱片收录在模组中但你希望移除，请联系我：</strong><br>我的 Discord：Supernoob#2768<br>我的邮箱（回复可能需要时间）：rainbowsupernoob@gmail.com</p>",
